cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its data, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Gumball API"
abstract: >-
  Gumball API is a free, read-only REST API about The Amazing World of Gumball
  and The Wonderfully Weird World of Gumball. It serves characters, locations,
  episodes, seasons, songs, games and in-universe media as JSON, with
  pagination, filters, sorting, lookups by id or slug, random picks and links
  between resources. The repository also includes the project website, with
  interactive documentation in English, Brazilian Portuguese and Spanish.
authors:
